"title":"超级雇佣兵荒岛求生","video_desc":"十年前秦家神秘灭门，秦枭死里逃生。十年后，秦枭已是海外顶级雇佣兵，回国查找仇人，伪装身份在林雨柔的身边，这天，他要保护林雨柔到一个神秘的岛上度假，而当他出现在飞机上时，不由得笑了。一架专门飞往神秘岛屿度假的贵族专机上，有秦家灭门后向他退婚并羞辱他的未婚妻，有对他见死不救还嘲笑他的亲戚，有一直挤兑他刁难他的上司，他这一生有仇有怨看不顺眼的人都不约而同地到了这架飞机上。","series_id":"7673414172503182361","episode":true,"vertical":true,"content_type":1,"recommend_info":"{\"channel_id\":\"94349560332\",\"request_id\":\"20261106233121BA566FBC4E0F158D73EE\",\"rank\":\"6\",\"queue_names\":\"shortplay\",\"final_queue_name\":\"heji\",\"gid\":\"7673414172503182361\",\"plan_id\":\"1\",\"is_show_ad_flag\":\"0\",\"series_pred_score\":\"{\\\"finish\\\":0.001987774157896638,\\\"staytime_stream\\\":1.406387448310852,\\\"collect\\\":0.04885777458548546,\\\"normalized_duration\\\":0.7667266130447388,\\\"stream_ctr\\\":0.027993710711598396,\\\"like\\\":0.06187598779797554,\\\"absolute_staytime\\\":0.1632455289363861}\"}","recommend_group_id":"7673414172503182361","play_cnt":4316101,"book_exist":false,"copyright":"湖南六翼影视","sub_title":"剧情·冒险求生","score":"8.2","use_video_model":true,"episode_cnt":80,"video_platform":3,"disable_play":false,"category_schema":"[{\"category_id\":5030,\"name\":\"剧情\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5030&categoryName=剧情&genreType=130&gender=1&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5086,\"name\":\"冒险求生\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5086&categoryName=冒险求生&genreType=130&gender=1&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5175,\"name\":\"打脸反派\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5175&categoryName=打脸反派&genreType=130&gender=1&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5158,\"name\":\"强者回归\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5158&categoryName=强者回归&genreType=130&gender=1&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5224,\"name\":\"大男主\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5224&categoryName=大男主&genreType=130&gender=1&source=detail\"},{\"category_id\":5338,\"name\":\"现代\",\"schema\":\"dragon8662://categorySearch?categoryId=5338&categoryName=现代&genreType=130&ge